# =============================================================================
# Static template: [kroener.DIGITAL] Prive Consent
# =============================================================================
# This template is intentionally empty since version 4.2.0.
#
# The cookie-consent banner (CSS link, cookie button and consent script) is
# injected into the page footer by the PHP PSR-14 event listener
# OliverKroener\OkPriveConsent\EventListener\InjectBannerScript
# (listening on AfterCacheableContentIsGeneratedEvent), NOT via TypoScript.
#
# The former `lib.priveScript` USER object and the
# `page.footerData.234797283` assignment were removed: rendering in PHP keeps
# the banner independent of TypoScript and site-set load order — a theme
# re-declaring `page = PAGE` can no longer discard the banner.
#
# The static template itself is kept so that existing TypoScript records which
# include it do not end up with a dangling reference. Including it is optional
# and has no effect.
# =============================================================================
